{
  "about": "Golden fixtures of the kiosk's money (PARITY.md gaps 1-3, guard rail 1): what a dish with its choices, a meal and a basket with promotions cost, in whole agorot. The expected numbers are derived from the Android till's Kotlin, which is the reference; the TypeScript port shared by the Windows and the browser kiosk (client/src/lib/kioskMoney.ts) must reproduce every one of them, and the Android kiosk is to run the same file (app/src/test/resources). Money: catalog / promotion prices in shekels as the cloud sends them; everything computed in agorot.",
  "version": 1,
  "pins": {
    "modifiers": "pos-android domain/LineDetails.kt ModifierMath.charges, ModifierMath.validate, ModifierMath.canAddOne; domain/MenuOrdering.kt DishDraft.unitPrice (product.price + Σ LineModifier.charged); domain/Menu.kt MenuCodec.parse (groups); the cloud's twin: pos-server app/services/menu.py price_picks / validate_picks",
    "mealPicks": "pos-android domain/MenuOrdering.kt MealDraft.pick",
    "meals": "pos-android domain/MenuOrdering.kt MealDraft.unitPrice (meal.price + Σ (choice.upcharge + component DishDraft.extras)), MealDraft.start (each component on its groups' defaults: ModifierMath.defaults), domain/Menu.kt MenuCodec.parse (meals)",
    "baskets": "pos-android domain/Promotions.kt PromotionEngine.evaluate (buyXGetY, bundle, itemDiscount, combo, gift, itemPrice, basketDiscount, spread, bestOrder, byPriority) and Promotion.isActiveAt; domain/PromotionMapper.kt fromDto / ruleOf; domain/Cart.kt Cart.withPromotions and Cart.totals (total = gross − promotions); domain/Vat.kt Vat.net; domain/KioskOrders.kt KioskCustomer.tipOf (the tip on the total after promotions, ui/kiosk/KioskViewModel.price)"
  },
  "modifiers": [
    {
